    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "Key finding: Health expenditure differs substantially across countries. Higher expenditure is concentrated mainly in high-income countries, while many low- and middle-income countries have substantially lower spending per person.\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "# RELATIONSHIP BETWEEN HIV AND HEALTH EXPENDITURE"
